/* Commit message:
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
** Beta Revision 4 Release **

Add: Slow crouch tool
Add: Toggle object info texts
Fix: Going into free mode now resets the level
Fix: Bug where you could disable free mode after finishing the map (weird stuff happens D:)
Fix: Bug bot outlines checking wrong variable for crouch enabled/disabled
Fix: Removed empty array on exported data (still worse than peace and taws on some cases)
Change: Open palette with melee
Change: Cancel ultimate controls to hold Q
Change: Toggle free mode with Interact + Reload (controller friendly)
Change: Updated controls menu
Change: RequireGrabR.O. now adds orbs + rr.oo. in a single counter on small messages
Refactor: Created TogglePlayerCollision sub
Refactor: Renamed BotUpdate to CallUpdate
Refactor: Renamed MenuPage to ObjectType
Refactor: Prettyfied sidebar controls
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

